        "nobel_worthiness": "GLP-1 physiology enabled a major therapeutic advance for diabetes and obesity with broad clinical and public-health significance.",
        "attribution": "Mojsov, Holst, and Drucker represent complementary peptide discovery, physiological, and translational contributions.",
        "maturity": "The therapeutic class has extensive clinical use and its physiological basis is well established.",
        "uncertainties": [
