        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett provide a focused pairing of disease-relevant splicing insight and therapeutic antisense development.",
        "maturity": "The intervention has demonstrated durable clinical importance and validates a wider therapeutic strategy.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The degree to which this should be recognized principally as a treatment-specific advance versus a broader RNA-therapeutics breakthrough is uncertain."
        ]
